# Sub-agents
> These rules apply to the `subagent` tool only. They do not apply to other forms of delegation, such as Pontia helpers.

Use sub-agents only in these situations:
  - Code review: delegate the review to independent sub-agents so their findings are not influenced by the main implementation context.

When you start more than one review sub-agent, run them in parallel.
